 *  today) or a date yyyy-mm-dd, and permission entries (when given) only for open, settle, void, reassign, close or
 *  reopen, each blank (the standing rule) or a comma separated list of clerk and steward, and grace days (when given) blank (off) or a whole number of days, and a note threshold (when given) blank (none) or an amount 0.00 or more with up to two decimals, and an entry date (when given) blank (off) or a date yyyy-mm-dd, and grades' grace (when given) only for grades A, B or C, each blank (none) or a whole number of days, and a pot (when given) blank (none) or an amount 0.00 or more with up to two decimals. */
